      "turns": [
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Hello Rachel, Daniel Lim here from the bank. Thanks for making time for the call. Are you somewhere comfortable to speak? I know your workday can be quite packed, so I'll keep this brief and leave the general administration until the end."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Hi Daniel. Yes, I'm in my office with the door closed. My next meeting isn't starting yet. Telephone is easier for me than arranging a visit, especially when I'm moving between the office and our other premises."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Certainly. Before we get into the discussion, could you provide your identification details for the telephone verification?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_012]] [[EV_013]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you, Rachel. We can move on to the discussion now. [[EV_001]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Please keep the explanation concise. I spend most of the day handling business matters, and I prefer to give my personal administration a separate slot rather than switch back and forth."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_002]] [[EV_003]]"
