          "text": "[[EV_014]] [[EV_015]] [[EV_016]] [[EV_017]] [[EV_018]] [[EV_019]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_009]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_010]] For routine contact, please continue calling me directly. My office team handles the company diary, but I keep personal banking calls out of that schedule."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "I'll note your contact preference. For general administration, if you're occupied when I call, I can leave a brief message asking you to return my call, without including private details. Would that arrangement suit your workday?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Yes, that's convenient. Sometimes I'm with customers and can't answer straight away. A short message is enough, and I'll call back when I'm somewhere quiet. No need to keep trying while I'm in a meeting."
